<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">TriADA: Massively Parallel Trilinear Matrix-by-Tensor Multiply-Add Algorithm and Device Architecture for the Acceleration of 3D Discrete Transformations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0071-5140" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2506.22818v1/orcid.svg" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:9/9;" width="9" height="9"></object> Stanislav Sedukhin</a>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>The University of Aizu
</span>
